OL,3,GNEWSAIncrease in urban exploration
OL,4,Asparks police warning
OL,5,
OL,6,FA police force has issued a warning
OL,7,Fabout the dangers of urban exploration
OL,8,Ffollowing an increase of reported
OL,9,Fincidents.
OL,11,FKnown as urbexing, the trend sees young
OL,12,Fpeople visit abandoned or empty sites
OL,13,Fand properties, often filming and
OL,14,Fsharing videos to social media, said
OL,15,FDorset Police.
OL,17,FThe force said it has created a new
OL,18,Fvideo aimed at parents, carers and
OL,19,Fguardians, warning that derelict sites
OL,20,Fcan be unsafe and have hidden hazards.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
