OL,3,GNEWSAIncrease in urban exploration
OL,4,Asparks police warning
OL,5,
OL,6,FPC Dominic Frost said: "Sadly, while
OL,7,Fsuch activities may be seen as amusing
OL,8,For thrill-seeking they can end in
OL,9,Ftragedy and I would urge those involved
OL,10,Fto stop before somebody is seriously
OL,11,Finjured or killed."
